'''Cats 'n Tanks''' (ネコ＆タンクネコ, ''Neko ando Tanku Neko'', '''Cat and Tank Cat''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

